{"c":[{"id":"15791adfd675f0b1","sum":"CLI ingest stamps subagent children from meta.subagentInfo; dashboard Task slots include CallDynamicTool cursor/Task. Plugin cache copies hold .git and Makefile, not dev markers. rectify replaces a dead shim of any owner; live foreign or unknown files stay.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261016T022227Z-ccb5b17bf805c62a","text":"CLI ingest stamps subagent children from meta.subagentInfo (parentAgentId, toolCallId, typeName). Dashboard Task slots include CallDynamicTool cursor/Task; children with a spawn id join before the zip.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T195949Z-b101405aa74423ff","text":"Marketplace plugin copies (Claude and Cursor caches) contain .git and Makefile: neither marks a dev checkout. shim rectify replaces a dead shim of any owner; live foreign shims and unidentified files stay untouched.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"05faf29885d0e87f","sum":"sr-initialize owner: default plugin dirs by path (cache/synced = claude/cursor); a checkout load is dev. Elsewhere CURSOR_PLUGIN_ROOT means cursor, else Claude asks. A substituted CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT is not proof. Agent shells never get that env; skill text gets the exact token.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261016T195949Z-c42d3773b4d4c55f","text":"sr-initialize owner: engine under .../cache/<mkt>/<plugin>/<ver> (or Claude synced/) is claude/cursor; any checkout load (--plugin-dir, Cursor plugins/local, mirror) is dev. Agent shells never get plugin-root env; Claude substitutes exact ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT} in skill text.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T215531Z-8195092923e19a0d","text":"sr-initialize owner: path decides in default plugins dirs (.claude/plugins/cache|synced, .cursor/plugins/cache); elsewhere CURSOR_PLUGIN_ROOT holding the engine is cursor, else Claude Code asks. Substituted CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT is not proof: --plugin-dir substitutes checkouts.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
